      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The impostor generators have been updated to 1.3.0, which includes a fix for this avatar. It tripped up the previous version of the generators because the feet of the main body were deleted - the \"dragon feet\" that exist outside the main armature are driven by parent constraints. 1.3.0 has updated logic to better detect constraint-driven hierarchies like this.",
